WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:20.065
Bird's friend, Goose, was visiting.

2
00:00:20.066 --> 00:00:24.507
Bird and Goose talked about bird things.

3
00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:28.236
"I love flying," said Bird.

4
00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:30.579
"Honk!" said Goose.

5
00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:36.129
"We love flying! Honk! Honk!"

6
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.101
Kip was not a bird.

7
00:00:40.102 --> 00:00:43.970
He was a chipmunk.

8
00:00:43.971 --> 00:00:50.553
So he couldn't talk about bird things.

9
00:00:50.554 --> 00:00:55.683
Bird and Goose talked and talked.

10
00:00:55.684 --> 00:01:01.811
Kip stood alone by the pond.

11
00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:14.150
He skipped stones on the water.

12
00:01:14.151 --> 00:01:16.922
But then Goose jumped into the water.

13
00:01:16.923 --> 00:01:21.103
She made a big splash.

14
00:01:21.104 --> 00:01:29.989
"Honk! Honk!" she said. "Pardon me! Honk!"

15
00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:33.457
People came over to the pond.

16
00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:40.223
They tossed pieces of bread to Goose.

17
00:01:40.224 --> 00:01:43.354
"Honk! Honk!" said Goose.

18
00:01:43.355 --> 00:01:46.850
"I don't like Goose," said Kip.

19
00:01:46.851 --> 00:01:51.080
"She's too big and too loud.

20
00:01:51.081 --> 00:01:56.796
I think I'll go somewhere else."

21
00:01:56.797 --> 00:01:59.403
Kip wandered away from the pond.

22
00:01:59.404 --> 00:02:02.604
Then he walked out of the park.

23
00:02:02.605 --> 00:02:13.915
Bird and Goose didn't even notice.
